---@field app mare.App The running application.
---@field window mare.Window? The window that made the call.
---@field webview_label string Label of the calling webview.
---@field state fun(name: string): any Fetch a value stored with `tauri.manage`.

---A frontend `Channel`, received as a field of `args`. Stream data back with `send`.
